	rdfs:comment "Each member of an sh:languageIn list is a string literal that is a basic language range (BCP47 / RFC 4647 section 2.1): '*', or alphanumeric subtags of 1 to 8 characters separated by '-', the first one alphabetic. The Working Group's base only checks that the members are literals, so a malformed range would otherwise match no language tag and nothing would say why."@en ;
